# EMIC Testing Requirement

- Add or update unit tests for every functional change (backend + frontend).
- Include positive AND negative cases (validation, 404/422/503, empty state, API errors).
- Backend: pytest; API routes via httpx ASGITransport + SQLite tmp DB; mock external services.
- Frontend: Vitest + React Testing Library; co-located `*.test.tsx`; mock fetch for `api.ts`.
- Run `.\test-windows.ps1` before finishing; do not mark work complete if tests fail.
- Do not skip tests unless the user explicitly requests it.
